  "description": "A .NET 10 redistribution of the Roboto font family, packaged for the CodeBrix family. Ships the Roboto variable font plus 36 static .ttf files (Light/Regular/Medium/SemiBold/Bold/ExtraBold weights in Normal/Italic styles across Normal/Condensed/SemiCondensed stretches), a font .ttf.manifest JSON, and a buildTransitive .targets file that prunes the unused static font set at consumer-build time. The whole package, code and fonts alike, is distributed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.",
